## Description

We raised $4.8M to build @laminalabs  and make AI explain with video, not just text.  Introducing Simi, the fastest way to make an explainer video.  Give it a single prompt or document, and it can generate a one-minute narrated explainer in as little as 20 seconds, in 80+ https://t.co/w2af7bQXhD

